AHB.audio({"groups": {"part-01-vocabulary": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f6a22d0c8ba9d11d.mp3", "text": "The team has a (1)… with NorthBridge."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/217091dcada3611e.mp3", "text": "Mr. Tarek sends an (2)… first."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/539fb60947f8d35b.mp3", "text": "He says, “(3)…, everyone.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e447845eeaca59f1.mp3", "text": "They talk about the next order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8a2cdd98be6a26fb.mp3", "text": "“Is June (4)…”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fc01ed0f82edaf7a.mp3", "text": "They (5)… on the plan and write the (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-02-grammar": [{"clips": [{"ar": "في الاجتماع، نوافق أو نرفض ببساطة وأدب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/82aff38166797a73.mp3", "text": "In a meeting, we agree or say no simply and politely."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/dd746b12b0286d45.mp3", "text": "To SAY YES: Yes, that's possible."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f75d8ef7b8e02c73.mp3", "text": "That's a good idea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1c7ed6bbd1afe04d.mp3", "text": "To SAY NO POLITELY: Sorry, that's not possible."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/760d295d11d72d17.mp3", "text": "Let me check."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cfe22be8d7bde7cc.mp3", "text": "We can discuss this."}, {"ar": "هذه عبارات قصيرة ولطيفة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c338d3537becb17a.mp3", "text": "These are short, kind phrases."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6f6ec27676406854.mp3", "text": "At A2, we keep it simple — we do not need long, difficult words."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1c2441163463fc81.mp3", "text": "We use CAN and COULD for polite requests in a meeting."}, {"ar": "can عادية. و could أكثر تهذيباً قليلاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/36605a8bf6e89951.mp3", "text": "CAN is normal; COULD is a little more polite."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/dc438f40e17b617f.mp3", "text": "Can we start now?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/db6de3c63de7ce38.mp3", "text": "Could you send the agenda?"}, {"ar": "هل يمكنكم التسليم في حزيران؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/010354c16752d5e9.mp3", "text": "Can you deliver in June?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e0b78e716af05313.mp3", "text": "We answer: Yes, of course. / Sorry, not today."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/795357a67e77b2d9.mp3", "text": "We use WOULD LIKE (I'd like / we'd like) to say what we want, politely."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cdd5422d8f2906bf.mp3", "text": "We would like to order more cement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1ecdf460d0a82eb5.mp3", "text": "We'd like a June delivery."}, {"ar": "هل تودّ أن نلتقي عبر الإنترنت؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5629353dfc7634ce.mp3", "text": "Would you like to meet online?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/13db53ca60607173.mp3", "text": "Remember: would like + to + verb, or would like + a noun."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ccc1605522422d53.mp3", "text": "Keep it simple and polite."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0e1d132f341665db.mp3", "text": "For agreement, short phrases are best: 'Yes, that's possible' or 'Sorry, not this time' (NOT long, difficult sentences)."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1dbde7d10cc4767b.mp3", "text": "Use 'would like', not 'want', to be polite: 'We would like to order more' (NOT 'We want to order more')."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-03-listening": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d5b220dc23172b5a.mp3", "text": "Listen and read. (Your teacher will read the dialogue, or play the audio.)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "أهلاً بك يا سيدة تشِن. شكراً على وقتك. هل نبدأ بجدول الأعمال؟", "speaker": "Mr. Tarek", "src": "../../assets/audio/9ca8335930df3a3d.mp3", "text": "Welcome, Ms. Chen. Thank you for your time. Shall we start with the agenda?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5cd0805907ff505a.mp3", "text": "Yes, of course. First, thank you for the last order. The cement was high quality."}, {"ar": "شكراً لك. ونحن سعداء أيضاً. ماذا تودّون هذه المرة؟", "speaker": "Mr. Tarek", "src": "../../assets/audio/96cafa18026f0428.mp3", "text": "Thank you. We are happy too. What would you like this time?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6dc7535d4c3556ad.mp3", "text": "We would like to order more — 2,000 tonnes. Can you deliver in June?"}, {"ar": "تسليم في حزيران. هل هذا ممكن يا فادي؟", "speaker": "Mr. Tarek", "src": "../../assets/audio/6a14b678a798d2d7.mp3", "text": "A June delivery — is that possible, Fadi?"}, {"ar": "نعم، هذا ممكن. يمكننا شحنه بحراً في أوائل حزيران.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/0bb1653f35182c31.mp3", "text": "Yes, that's possible. We can ship it by sea in early June."}, {"ar": "جيد. ولطلب أكبر، هل يمكنكم منح خصم أكبر؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/63639638eaa5901d.mp3", "text": "Good. And for a bigger order, could you give a bigger discount?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Lina", "src": "../../assets/audio/85c68c9b1fc0c334.mp3", "text": "For 2,000 tonnes, we can give 15% off. Is that good?"}, {"ar": "نعم، هذا جيد. نحن موافقون. شكراً للجميع.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f53907121e8ea001.mp3", "text": "Yes, that's good. We agree. Thank you, everyone."}], "title": "Dialogue D1"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "هل التسليم في حزيران ممكن؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/75ffef5c343b5b20.mp3", "text": "Is a June delivery possible?"}, {"ar": "نعم، هذا ممكن. يمكننا الشحن في أوائل حزيران.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/b736660699eb47bb.mp3", "text": "Yes, that's possible. We can ship in early June."}, {"ar": "جيد. وهل يمكنكم إرسال البضائع بحراً؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4d948ab3b89632ab.mp3", "text": "Good. And could you send the goods by sea?"}, {"ar": "بالطبع. البحر أرخص للطلب الكبير.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/4e314827adef745b.mp3", "text": "Of course. By sea is cheaper for a big order."}, {"ar": "ممتاز. وقائمة التعبئة، هل يمكنكم إرسالها مبكراً؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3003b0a07a2b1b9d.mp3", "text": "Perfect. And the packing list — can you send it early?"}, {"ar": "نعم، أستطيع. سأرسلها مع تحديث الشحن.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/2c9950ca579adf3d.mp3", "text": "Yes, I can. I will send it with the shipping update."}, {"ar": "شكراً لك. إذاً نحن متفقون.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4b831a3c54495f98.mp3", "text": "Thank you. We agree, then."}], "title": "Dialogue D2"}], "part-04-speaking": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bf04f5bcd7d6feca.mp3", "text": "A: Open the meeting ('Welcome."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1a3e6427662f93a5.mp3", "text": "Shall we start?')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1e5571b30270b1e9.mp3", "text": "B: Say what you'd like ('We would like to order more')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e06e63a1bdfd6d84.mp3", "text": "A: Ask a question ('Can you…' / 'Is … possible?')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/08e5ca6e080e1be5.mp3", "text": "B: Agree or say no politely ('Yes, that's possible')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/53a6d29b31d61e70.mp3", "text": "A: Close and agree the next steps ('Let's agree on…')."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-05-reading": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ebc76be2d0531dd5.mp3", "text": "What makes a good meeting?"}, {"ar": "يظن كثيرون أن الاجتماع يجب أن يكون طويلاً، بكلمات كبيرة وأفكار صعبة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/eb15b7c1ceff6735.mp3", "text": "Many people think a meeting must be long, with big words and hard ideas."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b81bfc353ab49159.mp3", "text": "But this is wrong."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/18dcd72881c5e8cd.mp3", "text": "The best meetings are short, simple, and clear."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/06b298190774412e.mp3", "text": "A good meeting does three things: it starts well, it stays clear, and it ends with an agreement."}, {"ar": "أولاً، الاجتماع الجيد يبدأ جيداً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/93cedafbe1c9b35f.mp3", "text": "First, a good meeting starts well."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/16dabd36f865c555.mp3", "text": "Before the meeting, the leader sends an agenda — a short list of the things to talk about."}, {"ar": "الآن يعرف الجميع الخطة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a5ea861ae8b68db3.mp3", "text": "Now everyone knows the plan."}, {"ar": "عندما يبدأ الاجتماع، يرحّب القائد بالجميع ويقول: هل نبدأ؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/13929c8ef2ea2709.mp3", "text": "When the meeting begins, the leader welcomes everyone and says, 'Shall we start?'"}, {"ar": "ترحيب دافئ وجدول أعمال واضح. هذه بداية جيدة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2500c8c7992329dd.mp3", "text": "A warm welcome and a clear agenda: this is a good start."}, {"ar": "ثانياً، الاجتماع الجيد يبقى واضحاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d5b9056fa9a349a8.mp3", "text": "Second, a good meeting stays clear."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f9b33a0c9a02edcf.mp3", "text": "People use simple words."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c327f0eceb46f7d7.mp3", "text": "They speak one at a time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e93fd474f10da8b3.mp3", "text": "They listen to each other."}, {"ar": "عندما يريد أحدهم شيئاً، يقوله ببساطة: نودّ أن نطلب المزيد.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/859a1c7e7be7f4e8.mp3", "text": "When someone wants something, they say it simply: 'We would like to order more.'"}, {"ar": "وعندما يوافق أحدهم، يقولها ببساطة: نعم، هذا ممكن.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c47c802b3470fc64.mp3", "text": "When someone agrees, they say it simply: 'Yes, that's possible.'"}, {"ar": "لا خطب طويلة ولا كلمات صعبة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/93a5700b07cd27b7.mp3", "text": "There are no long speeches and no difficult words."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/294d6b12457ea89e.mp3", "text": "Everyone understands everyone."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/92cd6450d54bb408.mp3", "text": "This is the secret: clear is better than clever."}, {"ar": "ثالثاً، الاجتماع الجيد ينتهي باتفاق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ddba10777edeb564.mp3", "text": "Third, a good meeting ends with an agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b795b9047578da13.mp3", "text": "This is the most important part."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/832a0c37b7ea1317.mp3", "text": "A meeting with no agreement is a waste of time."}, {"ar": "لذلك في النهاية، يقول القائد: لنتفق على الخطوات التالية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2059cd11f8704648.mp3", "text": "So, at the end, the leader says: 'Let's agree the next steps.'"}, {"ar": "عندئذٍ يعرف الجميع ما يجب فعله بعد ذلك.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2d85ef4dd169177d.mp3", "text": "Then everyone knows what to do next."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/72da1f7b9de28255.mp3", "text": "'We send a quotation."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9bd402281a06e51c.mp3", "text": "You send the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5885d9f411881f59.mp3", "text": "We ship in June.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b16e8710ef2ff24e.mp3", "text": "Now the meeting has a result."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f4d2f1f0449ed9a4.mp3", "text": "Everyone leaves with a clear plan."}, {"ar": "وهذا هو هدف الاجتماع: ليس الكلام، بل الاتفاق والعمل.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/310075c42f533bc4.mp3", "text": "And that is the point of a meeting: not to talk, but to agree and to act."}, {"ar": "لذا تذكّر: اجعله قصيراً، واجعله واضحاً، وأنهِه دائماً باتفاق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2b3bfb4eb437f431.mp3", "text": "So remember: keep it short, keep it clear, and always end with an agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b4305313dced086c.mp3", "text": "Do this, and your meetings will be good — and short."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e2f9414c9bfba891.mp3", "text": "And everyone will thank you for it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/526923a8378e268c.mp3", "text": "The best meetings are short, simple, and (1)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fa65572d5d5c68d5.mp3", "text": "They start with a warm welcome and an (2)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/33605d98ad874127.mp3", "text": "People use (3)… words and listen to each other."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1b166dcdcb14dfcc.mp3", "text": "And they end with an (4)…, so everyone knows the next (5)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/220fa7d913ce87e4.mp3", "text": "The point of a meeting is to agree and to (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-06-writing": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fe0f5a39b637ba86.mp3", "text": "Sentence starters: “We would like to meet you.” · “Can we meet on …” · “On the agenda: …”"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-07-trade-skills": [{"clips": [{"ar": "الاجتماع الجيد يبدأ قبل الاجتماع، بجدول الأعمال.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c7c01c766a5f5cae.mp3", "text": "A good meeting starts before the meeting — with the agenda."}, {"ar": "جدول الأعمال قائمة قصيرة بما سيُناقش، بالترتيب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6a5bc2db1e2508f2.mp3", "text": "An agenda is a short list of the things to talk about, in order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8afc1627b60ccbb7.mp3", "text": "Why is it so useful?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/854bcee82fa3c560.mp3", "text": "First, it helps everyone prepare."}, {"ar": "عندما يعرف الناس الخطة، يأتون مستعدين.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2028ae5a560245c9.mp3", "text": "When people know the plan, they come ready."}, {"ar": "ثانياً، يُبقي الاجتماع في مساره.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d1e521817b7452be.mp3", "text": "Second, it keeps the meeting on track."}, {"ar": "عندما يخرج الاجتماع عن الخطة، يقول القائد: لنعد إلى جدول الأعمال.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fdade947592443d7.mp3", "text": "When the meeting goes off the plan, the leader says, 'Let's go back to the agenda.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/024d1fcfce7f2cc5.mp3", "text": "Third, it saves time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/23e9f138e496d6e6.mp3", "text": "With an agenda, a meeting is short and clear."}, {"ar": "بدونه، قد يستمر الاجتماع بلا نهاية، وبلا نتيجة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c596248ccd77b90f.mp3", "text": "Without one, a meeting can go on and on, with no result."}, {"ar": "جدول الأعمال الجيد بسيط: تاريخ ووقت، ثم ثلاث أو أربع نقاط، ثم الخطوات التالية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/735cf238fed2a13f.mp3", "text": "A good agenda is simple: a date and time, then three or four points, then 'next steps'."}, {"ar": "وفي الاجتماع نفسه، للناس أدوار.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d5e96997eba898a9.mp3", "text": "In the meeting itself, people have roles."}, {"ar": "القائد يفتتح الاجتماع، ويتبع جدول الأعمال، ويختتمه.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/17d5b1f64d3e115c.mp3", "text": "The LEADER opens the meeting, follows the agenda, and closes it."}, {"ar": "الجميع يقدّم أفكاراً ويستمع.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d03225230ed4b846.mp3", "text": "EVERYONE gives ideas and listens."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7cfe49fe18d5889e.mp3", "text": "And one person — the NOTE-TAKER — writes the notes: what the meeting agreed, and the next steps."}, {"ar": "بعد الاجتماع، يرسل مدوّن الملاحظات الملاحظات إلى الجميع.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/381e3b2f7d0bdfcf.mp3", "text": "After the meeting, the note-taker sends the notes to everyone."}, {"ar": "الآن يوجد سجلّ مكتوب للاتفاق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fa8f3a900b912024.mp3", "text": "Now there is a written record of the agreement."}, {"ar": "جدول أعمال واضح، وأدوار واضحة، وملاحظات واضحة. هذه الأمور الثلاثة مهمة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1924ad9412e7ba2f.mp3", "text": "A clear agenda, clear roles, and clear notes: these three things matter."}, {"ar": "إنها تحوّل الاجتماع من حديث طويل إلى عمل جماعي جيد وسريع.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c594996837a25ace.mp3", "text": "They turn a meeting from a long talk into good, fast teamwork."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-08-consolidation": [{"clips": [{"ar": "كان الاجتماع قصيراً وجيداً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0cd908759aff8315.mp3", "text": "The meeting was short and good."}, {"ar": "الآن حان وقت أهم جزء: الاتفاق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/628d923d7a1a4f65.mp3", "text": "Now it is time for the most important part: the agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e1de86056543b844.mp3", "text": "Mr. Tarek looks at his notes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/65853e11b770de91.mp3", "text": "“Let's agree the next steps,” he says."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/deae2d48cb75cbd7.mp3", "text": "“First, we send a quotation for 2,000 tonnes, with a 15% discount."}, {"ar": "ثم ترسلون الطلب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/997fe1f0c0a65932.mp3", "text": "Then you send the order."}, {"ar": "ثم نشحن الإسمنت في أوائل حزيران، بحراً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/80bc376d8b93f871.mp3", "text": "Then we ship the cement in early June, by sea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c6101fb1026df964.mp3", "text": "And then you pay on time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3362063ae512bb56.mp3", "text": "Is that right?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/99418279d417c901.mp3", "text": "“Yes, that's right,” says Ms. Chen."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/44765256ea98d796.mp3", "text": "Everyone is clear."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a8ccb983c0adda79.mp3", "text": "Everyone knows the plan."}, {"ar": "لا كلمات كبيرة، ولا أفكار صعبة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1a35fd386831e44c.mp3", "text": "There are no big words, and no hard ideas."}, {"ar": "مجرد أربع خطوات بسيطة، ونعم من الطرفين.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/af45bd3197791157.mp3", "text": "Just four simple steps, and a 'yes' from both sides."}, {"ar": "هذا اتفاق جيد: قصير وواضح وعادل للطرفين.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f14daba30021c240.mp3", "text": "This is a good agreement: short, clear, and fair for both."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2aea9bad7aa174f9.mp3", "text": "After the meeting, Fadi sends the notes to everyone: “Thank you for the good meeting."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fe9407ef7cadd434.mp3", "text": "We agreed the next steps: 1) We send a quotation. 2) You send the order. 3) We ship in June. 4) You pay on time.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ac638415fd31f78c.mp3", "text": "Now there is a written record."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a3e415e274ea031d.mp3", "text": "If anyone forgets, they can read the notes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1395383659bef9f1.mp3", "text": "Karim reads them and smiles."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d33074732e33766c.mp3", "text": "“A good meeting,” he thinks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e81eb20e7547c248.mp3", "text": "“We talked, we agreed, and now we all know the plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/337d7b3c6d214697.mp3", "text": "That is teamwork."}, {"ar": "والاتفاق الواضح اليوم يوفّر مئة رسالة غداً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ce022bb366ff6c4e.mp3", "text": "And a clear agreement today saves a hundred emails tomorrow.”"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-09-cases": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4a671d2ac856d3a6.mp3", "text": "A partner starts a meeting with no agenda."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e7110a9f05c9a8b5.mp3", "text": "Nobody knows the plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/76f81e74286151ab.mp3", "text": "People talk about many things, but they agree on nothing."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f17c101c1be204d0.mp3", "text": "After an hour, the meeting ends with no result."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/329364a736e1e2df.mp3", "text": "Write one sentence to open a meeting with an agenda."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e2915b6f892eb948.mp3", "text": "A partner asks for a very big discount — 40% off."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cd0a0720e4a3d5b8.mp3", "text": "You cannot give that much."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fe14d64c26d7d777.mp3", "text": "But you do not want to be rude, and you want to keep the partner."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1990f519fb19ff47.mp3", "text": "A meeting ends with a good agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c74216e5b09d7f07.mp3", "text": "But nobody writes the notes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b3371a5d9810bbdf.mp3", "text": "One week later, the two sides do not agree on what they agreed."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/41be3a113afd2cf5.mp3", "text": "There is confusion."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-10-review": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5a5c37b41513f658.mp3", "text": "The meeting is online, at 10 o'clock."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/48d35f31ca0b8ddd.mp3", "text": "Mr. Tarek welcomes everyone and follows the agenda."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5d630bb2f32c8d8d.mp3", "text": "Ms. Chen would like to order 2,000 tonnes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4d74823b7063362e.mp3", "text": "A June delivery is possible, and Lina gives a 15% discount."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b50d064141bb8465.mp3", "text": "They agree the next steps and close the meeting."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ac23fa8de7f25a27.mp3", "text": "[Teacher reads] 'Welcome, everyone."}, {"ar": "هل نبدأ بجدول الأعمال؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/81a0c5f4ced519a1.mp3", "text": "Shall we start with the agenda?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4c77994a5299ecb0.mp3", "text": "We would like to order 2,000 tonnes."}, {"ar": "هل التسليم في حزيران ممكن؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/75ffef5c343b5b20.mp3", "text": "Is a June delivery possible?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/40ee9ae9bfb638d3.mp3", "text": "Yes, that's possible, with a 15% discount."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bcb2a35e7212e223.mp3", "text": "Good, we agree.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8d19ac8cd44db230.mp3", "text": "I can follow an agenda and give simple ideas."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-11-foundations": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c33fba32e5d04c45.mp3", "text": "This unit is about meetings."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d880d2c1788be26b.mp3", "text": "But it points to a deep and important skill: the art of agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2c063e1f6d20bfc0.mp3", "text": "This is how two sides find a 'yes' that is good for both."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3ae6ee7f4661ab95.mp3", "text": "This skill is useful everywhere: at work, at home, between friends, and even between countries."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/029c2f72babd2af9.mp3", "text": "The person who can help two sides agree is one of the most valuable people in any group."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/207b222627fc21ef.mp3", "text": "How do you help two sides agree?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/20aa1c234b57b264.mp3", "text": "The first step is not to speak."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/11c7e2da071921c2.mp3", "text": "It is to listen."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2faeeb19d09646a7.mp3", "text": "Many people think agreement is about talking — about winning with clever words."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b81bfc353ab49159.mp3", "text": "But this is wrong."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8e393ec384aa116a.mp3", "text": "The best way to agree is to listen first."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f20993838e8a12c7.mp3", "text": "When you listen, you understand what the other side really wants."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/42f987b32a7e95e7.mp3", "text": "And when people feel heard, they relax, and they want to agree too."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/afffeb36947a71e6.mp3", "text": "So the art of agreement starts with a quiet ear, not a loud voice."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/30cff6db0bfbcc76.mp3", "text": "The second step is to look for the 'yes' that is good for both."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c5ae7dc6edd82f7d.mp3", "text": "A bad agreement is one where one side wins and one side loses."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9da041c24bbd8746.mp3", "text": "The losing side is unhappy, and next time, they do not come back."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6a7c1735d556d9f2.mp3", "text": "A good agreement is different: both sides get something they want."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b91395ec9f6d724a.mp3", "text": "In this unit, Al-Hasan gets a bigger order, and NorthBridge gets a bigger discount."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c6450f6a2e34ed6f.mp3", "text": "Both are happy."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/35b271961cdf2373.mp3", "text": "Both come back."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0356c7087c3965b1.mp3", "text": "This is the secret: do not try to win."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/387ee3639aa3ea87.mp3", "text": "Try to find the deal where everyone wins."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/50e6a8803c4d99b5.mp3", "text": "Then everyone wants to work with you again."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/01ea1c8d9161ac20.mp3", "text": "So as you work with partners, remember the art of agreement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/518531c2f34d826f.mp3", "text": "Listen more than you speak."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e413bf7d70479018.mp3", "text": "Look for the 'yes' that is good for both sides."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4231346f13de256a.mp3", "text": "And keep it simple and kind."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cfcdc243c8ff91f1.mp3", "text": "You do not need clever words or hard tricks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/947ba87b290cef95.mp3", "text": "You need an open ear, a fair heart, and a clear plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b4aaf58730ef12e9.mp3", "text": "Do this, and people will love to work with you."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cfd78376e21ef22c.mp3", "text": "They will trust you, and they will come back, again and again."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8fbbf9a3441d5e1f.mp3", "text": "Because in business and in life, the greatest skill is not winning against people."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e3ea1749d8d26784.mp3", "text": "It is finding the way forward together."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/adc12490dd5964fd.mp3", "text": "Think of a time you and another person did not agree."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/67466547aaeef9a9.mp3", "text": "How did you find a 'yes'?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f4386923fcc95aba.mp3", "text": "Did you listen?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cb07ed2c373eb38a.mp3", "text": "Did both sides get something?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7a0d22c0728c9a68.mp3", "text": "Tell your partner."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2b2bb2bc255f6ce5.mp3", "text": "Write a few sentences (30–50 words) about a meeting."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a73609f3107c443c.mp3", "text": "Use 'would like', a request ('Can you…'), and a simple agreement ('Yes, that's possible')."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "warm-up": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8a980a0c42b1d2a6.mp3", "text": "Look at the pictures."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4fd321bc9b662ce4.mp3", "text": "Answer these questions before you read."}, {"ar": "اكتملت الصفقة الأولى مع نورث بريدج.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ee3237b457f1ef7f.mp3", "text": "The first deal with NorthBridge is complete."}, {"ar": "وصل الإسمنت، ودفعت السيدة تشِن في موعدها.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bede838ee30c9863.mp3", "text": "The cement arrived, and Ms. Chen paid on time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0dbb558fbd9d52cf.mp3", "text": "Now both companies want to do more business."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d009ba54572a3352.mp3", "text": "So they have a meeting."}, {"ar": "في الاجتماع، يتحدث الناس معاً ويتفقون على خطة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e647c5b5af0eeab9.mp3", "text": "In a meeting, people talk together and agree on a plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/269a4f393fe10ef8.mp3", "text": "The meeting is online."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/25f654f7fbb2ac0f.mp3", "text": "Mr. Tarek, the General Manager, leads it."}, {"ar": "أولاً، يرسل جدول أعمال، وهو قائمة بالأمور التي ستُناقش.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6f0617dbb9b1e5cd.mp3", "text": "First, he sends an agenda — a list of things to talk about."}, {"ar": "جدول الأعمال قصير: ترحيب، والطلب السابق، والطلب القادم، والأسعار، والخطوات التالية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a3f8e57f0ecf898d.mp3", "text": "The agenda is short: welcome, the last order, the next order, prices, and next steps."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9a02a7eb8bd38451.mp3", "text": "At 10 o'clock, the meeting begins."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5fa7ec41c898623f.mp3", "text": "“Welcome, Ms. Chen,” says Mr. Tarek."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/07e804444209af4b.mp3", "text": "“Thank you for your time."}, {"ar": "هل نبدأ بجدول الأعمال؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/22632c5ed68b4a88.mp3", "text": "Shall we start with the agenda?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/26bb6415f734ce18.mp3", "text": "“Yes, of course,” says Ms. Chen."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2206a9c1f6a8e738.mp3", "text": "“We are happy with the last order."}, {"ar": "كان الإسمنت عالي الجودة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b565ec308b09974f.mp3", "text": "The cement was high quality."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b909d6cdb783c54d.mp3", "text": "We would like to order more.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fca7bfa1e0daa3b3.mp3", "text": "“That is good news,” says Mr. Tarek."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/070fb3a89f7a472b.mp3", "text": "“How much would you like this time?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5972d75ac9e20ff0.mp3", "text": "“We'd like 2,000 tonnes,” says Ms. Chen."}, {"ar": "هل يمكنكم التسليم في حزيران؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/816697aff1ef6332.mp3", "text": "“Can you deliver in June?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/01a7fb9078629243.mp3", "text": "Mr. Tarek looks at Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f722056d07bbfc5f.mp3", "text": "“A June delivery — is that possible?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f7293a2b55ddb176.mp3", "text": "“Yes, that's possible,” says Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d6074bb8bf7aa018.mp3", "text": "“We can ship it by sea in early June.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0641538cbba244b9.mp3", "text": "“And the price?” asks Ms. Chen."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4a485ca6cb8128d7.mp3", "text": "“For a bigger order, can you give a bigger discount?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bd493ce69951234a.mp3", "text": "Lina answers."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/056c99504068907d.mp3", "text": "“For 2,000 tonnes, we can give 15% off."}, {"ar": "هل هذا مناسب لكم؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0923eb5cf23f1e6b.mp3", "text": "Is that good for you?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d980a9e396758f30.mp3", "text": "“Yes, that's good,” says Ms. Chen."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f340d6013440c581.mp3", "text": "The meeting ends well."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/af22896120f98e1b.mp3", "text": "They agree the next steps: Al-Hasan sends a quotation, NorthBridge sends the order, and Al-Hasan ships in June."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c681f0ef2e7b4f1e.mp3", "text": "“Thank you, everyone,” says Mr. Tarek."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/25be7b72984048fd.mp3", "text": "“This was a good meeting."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c8628886d8b498ab.mp3", "text": "We agree on the plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/39add999386f6247.mp3", "text": "Let's do good business again.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ed64c77e4b96b609.mp3", "text": "Everyone is happy."}, {"ar": "اجتماع قصير وواضح وودّي، وطلب جديد في الطريق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/96c8ede32d7df07b.mp3", "text": "A short, clear, friendly meeting — and a new order on the way."}], "title": "Read and listen"}]}, "unit": 8});
